# Signing material. An APK update must be signed with the same key as the
# install it replaces, so this keystore is the one secret in the project that
# actually matters — leaked, anyone could sign a build Android accepts as a
# legitimate update to this app. Never commit it or the password beside it.
key.properties
android/key.properties
*.jks
*.keystore
*.p12
